#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.mul:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``*`` operator (``__mul__``), so ``lf * other`` is "
"equivalent to ``lf.mul(other)``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``*`` 运算符（``__mul__``），因此 ``lf * other`` 等价于 ``lf.mul("
"other)``。"

